# Ticket-to-Asset Connection Configuration
# This utility loads environment from: asset-migration-script/.env
# Copy asset-migration-script/.env.example to asset-migration-script/.env and configure there.
#
# Required variables:
#   CLOUD_BASE_URL    - Jira Cloud instance URL
#   WORKSPACE_ID      - Assets workspace ID
#   CLOUD_API_TOKEN   - Base64 encoded email:api_token
#
# Optional variables:
#   DATACENTER_PATH=              - Path to datacenter asset exports (default: ../datacenter_assets)
#   CLOUD_API_TOKEN_2=            - Additional API token for parallel workers
#   CLOUD_API_TOKEN_3=            - Additional API token for parallel workers
